Breaks: a removal from refs on PostgreSQL and CockroachDB no longer share-locks the namespaces above the table, so it reads holds while a hold on one of them is being placed and takes the table out of its refs though the hold commits first (backlog 171).
Module: catalog-store-sql
Test: PostgresStoreSuiteTest$Refs#aRemovalWaitsForAnOpenHoldAboveTheTable

